'''Director Kurosawah''' (クロサワ監督, ''Kurosawa Kantoku'', '''Director Kurosawa''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]].

