==Trivia==
*Director Kurosawah's description references the legendary Japanese filmmaker [[wikipedia:Akira Kurosawa|Akira Kurosawa]]. ''Kuro'' is Japanese for "black", hence explaining his Dark trait, which was named Black before [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].
*The [[Media:Ghost chapel splash jp 2.png|second Japanese event poster]] for [[01 The Ghost Chapel|#01 The Ghost Chapel]] reveals that Kurosawah directed "The Sleepless Peng", which was previously mentioned in [[Condemned Peng]]'s description, and a movie adaptation of the novel "Eguchi Kōkō" (江口高校, "Eguchi High School"), which involves a girl's puberty and was mentioned in [[Professor A.]]'s Japanese description.

